/* SD2Cloud -- every text on screen: X(id, english, portuguese). UTF-8, Latin-1 characters only (the font has no
 * curly quotes or button symbols: the buttons are drawn separately).
 * Kept short on purpose: it's a TV screen, and whatever needs explaining goes in the README. The tone is a system
 * application's: Portuguese uses "Não foi possível..." for errors, "Deseja...?" for questions and "cartão de memória"
 * (never "save", but for the file browser's "Exportar save": the word a .psu is known by); a question about one save
 * names it ("Deseja eliminar \"%s\"?") instead of a vague "estes dados".
 * English uses "Unable to..." and plain sentences. After changing them, run
 * tools/check_messages.py (measures each text with the font and flags what doesn't fit its line). */
